<title>USA: PCX to trade eight new options beginning June 25.</title>
<headline>PCX to trade eight new options beginning June 25.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Friday it would list options on eight stocks on June 25.</p>
<p>The stocks include ChiRex Inc, CUNO Inc, HON Industries Inc, International Alliance Services Inc and Interstate Hotels Co. Also, KCS Energy Inc, Mail-Well Inc and Security Capital Pacific Trust.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols and the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits in number of contracts and lead market maker or pit rep.  </p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
